# Cross-origin isolation headers.
#
# This build uses pthreads, which need SharedArrayBuffer, which browsers only
# expose on a cross-origin isolated page. Without these two headers the game
# does not start at all -- on desktop or on a phone.
#
# Netlify and Cloudflare Pages read this file verbatim from the site root.
# For other hosts, the equivalent config is in emscripten/README-hosting.md.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
